          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>最近一期原租賃契約書（租約遺失時，改附切結書及印鑑證明）。</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>自備</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
